# C Programming – Functions and Recursion

## Overview
This directory contains C programming exercises demonstrating modular programming using functions and solving problems through recursive techniques.

## Topics Covered
- Function declaration, definition, and function calls
- Function parameters and return values
- Call by value
- Recursive function calls
- Factorial using recursion
- Fibonacci series using recursion
- Recursion-based problem solving

## Objective
To understand function-based program organisation and recursion in C through practical implementation and problem-solving exercises.
